00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:04.562
Whether it's due to lack of a father figure, a boredom with suburban life,

00:07:04.616 --> 00:07:07.826
or some other hidden factor, it's clear that Jennifer is trying to grow up

00:07:07.848 --> 00:07:08.418
too fast.

00:07:08.504 --> 00:07:11.254
As soon as they get there, she's talking about how she can't wait until

00:07:11.292 --> 00:07:14.086
she's old enough to get wasted, comments on all the guys she'd like to get with,

00:07:14.108 --> 00:07:16.914
and briefly demonstrates that she's already in an inappropriate relationship

00:07:16.962 --> 00:07:20.250
with a police cadet who's probably in his early twenties.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.585
-[Roman] Oh, don't do that.

00:07:23.147 --> 00:07:23.647
Not here.

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:27.766
Funny how Chris Pratt went from policing the smallest town ever to

00:07:27.798 --> 00:07:28.950
policing the whole dang galaxy.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:32.138
Jennifer acts confident in front of her friends, claiming that her boobs are

00:07:32.144 --> 00:07:34.474
like smart bombs that give her all the power over boys.

00:07:34.522 --> 00:07:37.416
But in practice, her insecurities surface and she's actually

00:07:37.416 --> 00:07:38.659
a super awkward flirt.

00:07:38.659 --> 00:07:42.290
–[Jennifer] You play your instruments really super good.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:45.598
She offers to buy the frontman Nikolai a drink, confident that she'll be

00:07:45.604 --> 00:07:47.934
able to convince the bartender to serve her because of her tits.

00:07:47.982 --> 00:07:49.698
And this actually works? No problem.

00:07:49.784 --> 00:07:52.695
But this quickly proves that she doesn't have the power over Nikolai. 

00:07:52.695 --> 00:07:54.210
He has the power over her.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.850
During his performance, they make quite a bit of eye contact and she looks transfixed,

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:59.842
almost hypnotized by his performance.

00:07:59.906 --> 00:08:03.186
When the band's amplifier shorts out and starts a huge fire,

00:08:03.218 --> 00:08:05.619
she hardly seems to notice until Needy pulls her away to safety.

00:08:05.619 --> 00:08:09.234
Outside the venue, Nikolai finds them and invites them into his van for safety.

00:08:09.282 --> 00:08:11.270
It's one of the strangest scenes you'll ever see.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.574
Needy is traumatized.

00:08:12.642 --> 00:08:13.926
Jennifer is still spellbound.

00:08:13.958 --> 00:08:17.158
But Nikolai is casually drinking a beverage as people are being cooked alive

00:08:17.174 --> 00:08:18.250
in the building behind them.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.302
He gives Jen a sip of his drink, claiming it'll bring her out of shock.

00:08:21.366 --> 00:08:22.854
Then he pulls her along to the van.

00:08:22.902 --> 00:08:26.448
As Needy tries to convince her to come back to town and get nachos at their favorite spot.

00:08:26.448 --> 00:08:29.018
Jennifer is being presented with a symbolic choice.

00:08:29.114 --> 00:08:32.663
She's a 16 year old caught right on the line between childhood and adulthood.

00:08:32.663 --> 00:08:34.554
Going back to Needy represents safety.

00:08:34.602 --> 00:08:37.385
Going back to the suburbs with her childhood friend and predictability.

00:08:37.385 --> 00:08:39.794
While going on with Nikolai and the band from the big city

00:08:39.832 --> 00:08:42.094
represents alcohol, sex, and danger.

00:08:42.142 --> 00:08:44.210
All things that she associates with growing up.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:47.506
Because she's so hypnotized by Nikolai, she chooses to go into the van with him.

00:08:47.528 --> 00:08:51.186
It's only after they drive off and she sees occult objects in books

00:08:51.218 --> 00:08:54.150
that she realizes she's in over her head and starts to freak out.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:58.454
When she hears one of the band members ask Nikolai if he's sure that she's a virgin, she lies,

00:08:58.454 --> 00:09:00.506
thinking she'll convince them not to try anything with her.

00:09:00.951 --> 00:09:01.741
-[Jennifer] I'm a virgin.

00:09:01.741 --> 00:09:03.606
I've never even done sex.

00:09:03.638 --> 00:09:04.650
I don't know how.

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:08.362
So you guys should find somebody who does.

00:09:08.496 --> 00:09:11.402
She doesn't realize it yet, but that's not what they're interested in.

00:09:11.456 --> 00:09:14.986
The band has plans to sacrifice a virgin to Satan under the waxing moon in

00:09:15.008 --> 00:09:17.034
exchange for legendary rock and roll fame.

00:09:17.082 --> 00:09:19.678
I've watched the whole sequence with the fire and the departure from the

00:09:19.684 --> 00:09:22.814
venue multiple times, trying to figure out if starting the fire was also

00:09:22.852 --> 00:09:24.602
part of the plan or part of the ritual.

00:09:24.666 --> 00:09:26.958
It appears to just be a random electrical fire.

00:09:27.044 --> 00:09:30.426
However Nikolai acts so casually about it, it makes me think that the demon

00:09:30.458 --> 00:09:33.326
may have played a part in starting it in order to give them a reason to take

00:09:33.348 --> 00:09:34.682
a young girl away in their van.

00:09:34.746 --> 00:09:37.606
There's also the fact that earlier on, Needy can be seen playing these

00:09:37.628 --> 00:09:39.522
pinball machines, fire and getaway.

00:09:39.586 --> 00:09:41.510
Almost like they're predicting what's about to happen.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:44.258
As if a higher power has dictated their destiny.

00:09:44.354 --> 00:09:47.206
Also, the first thing that's likely to come to your mind when Jennifer gets

00:09:47.228 --> 00:09:50.262
into their van is that she's about to be a victim of something else.

00:09:50.316 --> 00:09:53.214
That she may be coerced into becoming an underage groupie.

00:09:53.282 --> 00:09:56.314
This is obviously a trope in the world of touring musicians from the early

00:09:56.352 --> 00:09:58.698
days of rock and roll that has persisted until the present.

00:09:58.784 --> 00:10:01.958
There's a whole TikTok trend of girls sharing outfits to try to get noticed

00:10:01.974 --> 00:10:03.190
by an artist at a concert.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:06.974
A lot of that is probably delusion, but as I said earlier, stereotypes do

00:10:07.012 --> 00:10:08.122
often come from somewhere.

00:10:08.186 --> 00:10:11.566
And sadly, there are cases where the adult musicians take advantage of

00:10:11.588 --> 00:10:13.450
unwavering fandom from their young fans.

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:17.601
Low Shoulder's sacrifice of Jennifer is very much an allegory for that type of behavior.

00:10:17.646 --> 00:10:20.279
And this is briefly confirmed by Diablo Cody in an interview.

00:10:20.717 --> 00:10:24.790
-[Diablo] It is dealing with themes of like consent, assault, abuse of power.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:28.537
And this can be seen in the way that they tie her down and the knife represents...

00:10:28.537 --> 00:10:30.394
-[Dirk] Dude, that is a hot murder weapon.

00:10:30.462 --> 00:10:31.590
Yeah, I think you get the idea.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:35.170
But the entire ritual hinges on the idea that Jennifer is actually a virgin,

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.950
which, as we know, she is not.

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:40.242
According to the books in the occult section at Devil's Kettle High library,

00:10:40.306 --> 00:10:43.334
the ritual can still be performed, but may result in something known as

00:10:43.372 --> 00:10:44.658
demonic transference.

00:10:44.754 --> 00:10:48.118
-[Anita] If the human sacrifice is impure, the result may still be attained,

00:10:48.124 --> 00:10:50.346
but the demon will forever reside in the soul of the victim.

00:10:50.378 --> 00:10:52.682
She must forever feed on flesh to sustain the demon.

00:10:52.746 --> 00:10:54.234
The text goes on to elaborate.

00:10:54.282 --> 00:10:57.434
We don't see the entire page at any point, but by combining multiple shots,

00:10:57.482 --> 00:10:59.022
I was able to piece together most of it.

00:10:59.076 --> 00:11:01.518
Most of it's not that interesting, but there are a couple of things that I

00:11:01.524 --> 00:11:02.170
want to highlight.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.130
The Romans believe that some deities transferred to animals.

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:08.094
This is why many sculptures of animals can be found near all

00:11:08.142 --> 00:11:09.390
Roman archaeological sites.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:10.594
We'll come back to that.

00:11:10.632 --> 00:11:14.434
But the result of the botched ritual is that Jennifer is turned into a succubus.

00:11:14.434 --> 00:11:17.186
There are surprisingly few examples of succubi appearing in movies.

00:11:17.208 --> 00:11:20.002
So I did some research... paranormal research.

00:11:20.136 --> 00:11:23.126
Traditionally, a succubus is a demon that appears in a female form who

00:11:23.148 --> 00:11:26.198
seduces men in their sleep to steal their souls, or, in some cases of the mythology,

00:11:26.204 --> 00:11:29.318
steal their semen in order to create evil children with the

00:11:29.324 --> 00:11:30.370
powers of witchcraft.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.302
The idea first started appearing in folklore around the medieval period.

00:11:33.366 --> 00:11:36.326
It may have been a legend created to try to explain the phenomenon of

00:11:36.358 --> 00:11:38.022
wet dreams or even sleep paralysis.

00:11:38.086 --> 00:11:41.526
Jennifer's Body has a unique spin on the legend, wherein the succubus eats

00:11:41.558 --> 00:11:44.590
males as a means of satiating the demon's hunger and giving it power.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:48.506
The library books mention flesh eating and racious feeding, the demon becomes

00:11:48.538 --> 00:11:51.758
weaker as it gets hungry, and eating flesh will revitalize her power.

00:11:51.844 --> 00:11:54.746
So although she should have been killed by the knife wounds, she survived

00:11:54.778 --> 00:11:58.130
due to demonic transference and woke up alone, not able to remember anything.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.894
Going back to our rock and roll tour bus metaphor,

00:12:00.942 --> 00:12:03.810
this represents the idea of her getting roofied and blacking out.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:06.850
In this case, her supernatural abilities are an allegory for changes

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.142
experienced during puberty.

00:12:08.206 --> 00:12:10.114
That's why she's seducing and eating boys.

00:12:10.162 --> 00:12:13.474
And her strange behavior could be explained as puberty induced mood swings.

00:12:13.522 --> 00:12:16.690
For example, she wanders back to Needy's house and sneaks into her kitchen.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:20.598
She's totally silent, only flashing her friend a red smile before pulling a

00:12:20.604 --> 00:12:23.090
rotisserie chicken out of the fridge and eating it off the ground.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:26.074
She would later explain that she was hungry but didn't want to kill her best friend.

00:12:26.112 --> 00:12:27.914
So she went for the chicken instead.

00:12:28.032 --> 00:12:29.014
Always a good choice.

00:12:29.062 --> 00:12:31.585
But her new demonic sensibilities seem to reject it

00:12:31.951 --> 00:12:34.412
(ROAR)

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:38.074
and she ends up projectile vomiting this black spiky sludge.

00:12:38.122 --> 00:12:41.406
It seems to be her body's way of rejecting normal human food and telling her

00:12:41.428 --> 00:12:44.751
that she won't be able to sustain herself with anything other than human flesh.

00:12:44.751 --> 00:12:47.502
She starts laughing like a maniac when she realizes this.

00:12:47.556 --> 00:12:50.162
It's not a happy laugh, it's more of a weird coping thing.

00:12:50.216 --> 00:12:53.454
She's taken advantage of Needy her entire life and now she's ironically

00:12:53.502 --> 00:12:54.562
going to have to eat her.

00:12:54.616 --> 00:12:57.294
So she pins her friend to the wall and begins to bite her neck.

00:12:57.342 --> 00:13:00.598
But in the end, she can't bring herself to do it and disappears into the night.

00:13:00.604 --> 00:13:04.434
As she wandered back home, she encountered Ahmet,

00:13:04.482 --> 00:13:06.002
an Indian exchange student that she had been eyeing earlier.

00:13:06.066 --> 00:13:09.298
He becomes her first victim when she takes him into the woods and devours

00:13:09.314 --> 00:13:11.030
him to restore some of the demon's power.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.926
It's clear that she doesn't yet realize that she's become a succubus.

00:13:13.958 --> 00:13:16.426
She just sees her new impulses as natural changes.

00:13:16.528 --> 00:13:20.173
The next day, the fire at Melody Lane and the 47 lives lost is the

00:13:20.173 --> 00:13:20.770
talk of the school.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.326
But Jennifer shows up with a new lease on life.

00:13:23.751 --> 00:13:26.581
(IMPACT)

00:13:28.656 --> 00:13:32.610
♪ Synth Music ♪

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:35.822
At school in the morning, Needy is surprised to see Jennifer looking

00:13:35.876 --> 00:13:37.464
completely normal as she plays off

00:13:37.464 --> 00:13:39.534
the bizarre events of the previous night as Needy

00:13:39.582 --> 00:13:40.610
overreacting again.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:43.586
She's also completely unfazed to learn about the people who died in the fire.

00:13:43.608 --> 00:13:47.106
Even after finding out the casualties included eight students and a teacher.

00:13:47.106 --> 00:13:49.401
-[Jennifer] Sucks to be them, I guess.

00:13:49.401 --> 00:13:51.894
Jennifer is back to being her usual toxic self, 

00:13:51.932 --> 00:13:55.505
but she kind of takes it to a new level that makes her seem straight up sociopathic.

00:13:55.505 --> 00:13:57.551
While the rest of the community is in shambles.

00:13:57.551 --> 00:14:01.006
After school, she approaches the school football captain, Jonas Kozelle,

00:14:01.006 --> 00:14:02.402
who is really emotionally distraught.

00:14:02.466 --> 00:14:05.351
On the surface, it looks like he's upset about losing his best friend Craig

00:14:05.351 --> 00:14:06.070
in the fire.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:09.554
However, Jennifer and a select few others know that just one day earlier

00:14:09.602 --> 00:14:11.422
Jonas was in a fight with Craig over a girl.

00:14:11.476 --> 00:14:15.000
So the emotions he's feeling are really rooted in self pity and low self esteem.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.294
This makes it easy for her to manipulate him.

00:14:17.332 --> 00:14:19.867
She takes him to a spot in the woods that's popular for hookups,

00:14:19.867 --> 00:14:21.966
telling him it's what Craig would have wanted.

00:14:22.068 --> 00:14:25.290
They find themselves surrounded by a huge assortment of wild animals.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.282
This is probably one of the strangest mysteries surrounding Jennifer.

00:14:28.346 --> 00:14:31.484
This could be connected to the text in the demonology books from the library,

00:14:31.484 --> 00:14:34.346
claiming that Romans believe that sometimes demonic transference would transfer

00:14:34.378 --> 00:14:38.025
the entity into animals, leading them to create grand animal sculptures.

00:14:38.025 --> 00:14:41.031
Another idea I had is that this is supposed to be like a fairy tale moment,

00:14:41.031 --> 00:14:42.630
like the animals in Snow White.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:45.746
Basically to create the idea that everything is gonna be okay for Jonas.

00:14:45.778 --> 00:14:48.486
Things are gonna get better now that he and Jennifer are together,

00:14:48.508 --> 00:14:50.866
when in reality they're just lining up for his leftovers.

00:14:50.898 --> 00:14:55.194
After what happens next, Jennifer slams him into a tree and transforms into

00:14:55.232 --> 00:14:58.538
the flesh ripping form of the succubus, where she proceeds to chow down and

00:14:58.544 --> 00:15:01.846
devour his insides, finally replenishing her and relieving the demon's hunger.

00:15:01.878 --> 00:15:03.734
To clean the carnage off of herself,

00:15:03.782 --> 00:15:05.654
she jumps in the lake and goes for a swim.

00:15:05.702 --> 00:15:08.062
When she gets out, you can see the steam coming off of her.

00:15:08.116 --> 00:15:11.246
That night she tells Needy that she's feeling better than ever and

00:15:11.268 --> 00:15:14.490
she famously burns her tongue with a lighter and watches it heal immediately.

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:18.046
She even calls herself a God and starts asking about Needy's boyfriend

00:15:18.068 --> 00:15:18.686
as if she's interested.

00:15:18.788 --> 00:15:21.938
Devouring Jonas seems to give her a huge boost and she appears to be the

00:15:21.944 --> 00:15:24.786
only happy person in the school, though she at least seems to keep a low

00:15:24.808 --> 00:15:26.462
enough profile for Jonas's funeral.

00:15:26.526 --> 00:15:29.978
Earlier I mentioned that Jen's cannibalistic rampage is actually a metaphor

00:15:30.014 --> 00:15:31.078
for her sleeping around.

00:15:31.164 --> 00:15:34.374
We know that she has insecurity problems, so it's obvious that she's using

00:15:34.412 --> 00:15:36.402
these encounters to boost her self esteem.

00:15:36.466 --> 00:15:39.382
In a literal sense, her health is improving because the consumption of human

00:15:39.436 --> 00:15:41.334
flesh gives the demon power to sustain her.

00:15:41.372 --> 00:15:44.198
But what this really represents is her going to bed with someone to boost her ego,

00:15:44.214 --> 00:15:47.258
feeling the emotional high that comes with that for a little while,

00:15:47.344 --> 00:15:49.450
then sinking back into being miserable again.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:52.298
If she doesn't keep feeding, the demon's hunger will always return.

00:15:52.384 --> 00:15:55.566
This is a temporary solution that never addresses the root of the issue.

00:15:55.668 --> 00:15:59.226
Shortly after, Jennifer gets paired up with local Green Day influencee Colin Grey

00:15:59.258 --> 00:16:01.774
in science class, and although it's awkward at first,

00:16:01.812 --> 00:16:04.666
they bond over their love of the punk rock band The Dwarves and eventually

00:16:04.698 --> 00:16:06.798
become friends... at least in Colin's eyes.

00:16:06.884 --> 00:16:09.618
Jennifer doesn't seem to have any respect for him outside of class.

00:16:09.704 --> 00:16:13.106
Meanwhile, the band Low Shoulder gains national radio recognition and

00:16:13.128 --> 00:16:15.582
they're celebrated as the heroes of the Melody Lane tragedy.

00:16:15.646 --> 00:16:18.718
Their song through the trees is sung at a candlelight vigil for the victims,

00:16:18.734 --> 00:16:21.334
and it becomes the town's unofficial anthem over the course of the next month.

00:16:21.372 --> 00:16:24.694
I have to imagine that this really agitated Jennifer because not only

00:16:24.732 --> 00:16:27.606
does she know firsthand that they're evil, but they literally tried to

00:16:27.628 --> 00:16:29.714
sacrifice her in exchange for their fame.

00:16:29.762 --> 00:16:32.038
When she finds out that they'll be releasing a benefit single for the victims,

00:16:32.044 --> 00:16:34.790
she comments on how she thinks the production is poor.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:38.106
She also tells Needy that she's not feeling great, which leads to my

00:16:38.128 --> 00:16:39.366
favorite line of hers.

00:16:39.478 --> 00:16:41.193
-[Anita] Are you PMSing or something?

00:16:41.193 --> 00:16:45.638
-[Jennifer] PMS isn't real, Needy. It was invented by the boy run media to make us seem crazy.

00:16:45.744 --> 00:16:48.910
She also makes an offhand comment about how it must be wearing off.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:52.206
It's been a month since she turns Jonas into an afterschool snack,

00:16:52.228 --> 00:16:54.138
so the demonic benefits are starting to dissipate.

00:16:54.234 --> 00:16:57.694
But despite looking like what she refers to as one of the normal girls,

00:16:57.742 --> 00:17:00.638
she's still garnering attention from her male classmates and Colin invites her

00:17:00.654 --> 00:17:03.682
to a showing of Rocky Horror, which she initially turns down because she

00:17:03.736 --> 00:17:06.126
quote, doesn't like boxing movies.

00:17:06.238 --> 00:17:10.000
Colin is so dumbfounded by this comment that he just gives up and walks away.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.034
Which is 100% the right response.

00:17:12.082 --> 00:17:15.222
It's not until Needy mentions that she actually thinks Colin is really cool

00:17:15.276 --> 00:17:18.422
that Jennifer changes her mind and invites him over to her place.

00:17:18.556 --> 00:17:21.190
This just shows her insecurity peeking through again.

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.586
She's literally not interested in him until she realizes she can use him as

00:17:24.608 --> 00:17:26.102
a means of dominating Needy.

00:17:26.166 --> 00:17:28.986
However, the address that she gives him is not her house,

00:17:29.008 --> 00:17:29.818
it's a construction site.

00:17:29.904 --> 00:17:33.206
She's decorated an upstairs room with candlelights and a blanket and

00:17:33.238 --> 00:17:35.174
leaves some music playing, waiting for him to arrive.

00:17:35.222 --> 00:17:37.867
And when he does, she tries to get down to it immediately.

00:17:37.867 --> 00:17:40.766
We see a pack of rats run in their direction, similar to how her

00:17:40.788 --> 00:17:43.722
encounter with Jonas attracted some wild animals a month earlier.

00:17:43.786 --> 00:17:46.879
Her eyes suddenly go yellow and she backs him into a sharp tool.

00:17:46.879 --> 00:17:50.830
-[Jennifer] Ooh… Puncture wound, God, that’s so emo.

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:52.530
That was totally uncalled for.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:55.705
She twists and snaps his forearm and as she finishes him off,

00:17:55.705 --> 00:17:57.122
that is finishes killing him.

00:17:57.176 --> 00:17:59.368
The last thing he hears is this phrase.

00:17:59.497 --> 00:18:02.386
-[Jennifer] I need you frightened. I need you hopeless.

00:18:02.498 --> 00:18:05.686
And while all this is going on, it's intercut with Needy who is with her

00:18:05.708 --> 00:18:06.614
boyfriend at the time.

00:18:06.652 --> 00:18:09.986
And she inexplicably starts repeating the word hopeless as she sees visions

00:18:10.018 --> 00:18:11.122
of Jennifer's victims.

00:18:11.186 --> 00:18:14.086
For the sake of time, I'm not going to speculate on this unless I do a Needy

00:18:14.118 --> 00:18:14.890
episode in the future.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:18.122
But I bring it up because the word hopeless becomes a theme between the two.

00:18:18.176 --> 00:18:20.906
Basically, part of their relationship involves Jennifer keeping her

00:18:20.928 --> 00:18:23.894
best friend under her thumb by constantly knocking her down in order to

00:18:23.942 --> 00:18:24.670
raise herself up.

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:27.675
My speculation is that when she says I need you hopeless,

00:18:27.675 --> 00:18:29.274
that's really directed at Needy.

00:18:29.322 --> 00:18:32.062
Who's the reason that she invited Colin over in the first place.

00:18:32.196 --> 00:18:35.454
Anyway, after growing out her fang, she tears Colin apart with them,

00:18:35.492 --> 00:18:37.322
then crouches down and slurps up his blood.

00:18:37.386 --> 00:18:40.046
After this, she crosses through the woods and climbs out into the street

00:18:40.078 --> 00:18:41.730
where she's nearly hit by Needy's car.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:44.942
Needy manages to avoid the collision, but Jennifer jumps on her windshield,

00:18:45.006 --> 00:18:47.038
cracking it and flashes a bloody smile.

00:18:47.134 --> 00:18:50.786
She most likely wants to intimidate Needy and basically continue to dominate her.

00:18:50.818 --> 00:18:53.638
So she sneaks into her house and waits for her in her bed.

00:18:53.724 --> 00:18:56.946
This not only demonstrates that Jennifer knows about Needy's feelings towards her,

00:18:56.978 --> 00:18:59.846
but she's also willing to manipulate them in order to have

00:18:59.868 --> 00:19:00.751
control over her.

00:19:00.751 --> 00:19:01.500
-[Jennifer] Hi!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:02.439
(Screams)

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:05.706
Needy screams at her to get out, but she just kinda downplays it.

00:19:05.728 --> 00:19:08.502
Reminding her that they used to share a bed together during slumber parties.

00:19:08.566 --> 00:19:10.614
She tries to calm her down by playing with her hair.

00:19:10.662 --> 00:19:13.110
And it leads to something a little bit more intimate.

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:14.874
We know this isn't their first kiss.

00:19:14.922 --> 00:19:17.998
But based on Needy's reaction, I'm guessing it may be their second.

00:19:18.084 --> 00:19:20.058
And the chemistry cannot be understated.

00:19:20.154 --> 00:19:21.933
You know the YouTube channel movie clips?

00:19:21.933 --> 00:19:24.581
The channel that just posts clips from pretty much every movie?

00:19:24.581 --> 00:19:26.430
They posted five clips from Jennifer's body.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.103
But this kissing scene is by far the most popular.

00:19:29.103 --> 00:19:32.562
At the time of writing this, it has 419,000,000 views,

00:19:32.562 --> 00:19:35.480
making it the fourth most watched movie clip of all time.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:37.538
The comment section just kind of says it all.

00:19:37.624 --> 00:19:41.142
Special thanks to Megan Fox and Amanda Seyfried for making my teenage years

00:19:41.196 --> 00:19:43.298
ten times more complicated with this scene.

00:19:43.394 --> 00:19:44.518
This scene is amazing.

00:19:44.604 --> 00:19:48.166
You can see how Needy is slowly seduced by Jennifer and how she gives in to

00:19:48.188 --> 00:19:49.542
some hidden desire she had.

00:19:49.596 --> 00:19:51.062
My hormone crazed teen self,

00:19:51.116 --> 00:19:53.110
took 5 hours to finish this movie.

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:56.006
You know what? I think we can stop reading the comments.

00:19:56.118 --> 00:19:58.282
The point is that this scene really stuck with people.

00:19:58.336 --> 00:20:01.322
But this intimate encounter would not be the only reason their friendship

00:20:01.386 --> 00:20:03.310
would be forever changed.

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.310
(IMPACT)

00:20:07.946 --> 00:20:10.704
♪ Suspenseful Music ♪

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:15.326
When Needy finally breaks out of the trance that Jennifer has her in

00:20:15.348 --> 00:20:17.294
and realizes how weird all this is,

00:20:17.332 --> 00:20:20.034
she threatens to call the police over the gory incident that she saw

00:20:20.072 --> 00:20:21.582
Jennifer in shortly beforehand.

00:20:21.646 --> 00:20:24.174
But she's reminded that Jennifer is sleeping with a cadet.

00:20:24.222 --> 00:20:25.742
Which she believes will give her immunity.

00:20:25.806 --> 00:20:28.578
She decides to finally explain everything that happened on the night of the fire.

00:20:28.584 --> 00:20:33.702
The satanic indie band, the attempted sacrifice, 867-5309, eating Ahmet,

00:20:33.756 --> 00:20:35.170
and her newfound powers.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.866
When she's full, she can't be killed,

00:20:36.898 --> 00:20:38.482
and any wounds heal instantly.

00:20:38.546 --> 00:20:40.438
When Needy starts to ask too many questions,

00:20:40.524 --> 00:20:42.370
which start to sound like accusations,

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:45.366
Jen suggests that maybe she should talk to a shrink about her disturbing thoughts.

00:20:45.398 --> 00:20:48.006
Basically implying that these are all Needy's ideas.

00:20:48.038 --> 00:20:50.310
And she's not planning on admitting to any wrongdoing.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:51.482
When asked to leave again,

00:20:51.536 --> 00:20:54.446
she jumps out the top floor window and disappears into the night.

00:20:54.548 --> 00:20:55.822
Another month passes by

00:20:55.876 --> 00:20:57.674
and without having eaten any new boys

00:20:57.722 --> 00:20:59.790
Jennifer's physical condition worsens again.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:03.146
Meanwhile, the newest worry in town has become this cannibal serial killer

00:21:03.178 --> 00:21:04.542
targeting teenage boys.

00:21:04.676 --> 00:21:06.202
-[Chip] Ladies pepper spray?

00:21:06.266 --> 00:21:09.014
-[Mrs. Dove] There’s obviously a sicko out there who likes boys. 

00:21:09.082 --> 00:21:12.126
And I think this kind of ties back into the violation assault themes

00:21:12.158 --> 00:21:13.822
that I talked about during the ritual scene.

00:21:13.886 --> 00:21:15.826
Jennifer had this horrible thing happen to her

00:21:15.848 --> 00:21:17.278
and it turned her into this monster.

00:21:17.374 --> 00:21:20.114
Now she's turning the traditional safety procedures on their head.

00:21:20.152 --> 00:21:21.622
And it's the boys who have to arm themselves.

00:21:21.676 --> 00:21:24.038
With self defense tactics usually reserved for women.

00:21:24.124 --> 00:21:26.668
This is where Needy's research into the occult convinces her

00:21:26.668 --> 00:21:28.434
that Jennifer's planning to make a buffet out of the

00:21:28.482 --> 00:21:30.614
Devil’s Kettle High Spring Formal Dance.

00:21:30.662 --> 00:21:33.386
Which would take place on April 18th, 2008.

00:21:33.488 --> 00:21:35.000
-[Anita] Jennifer's evil.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.000
-[Chip] I know.

00:21:36.351 --> 00:21:37.937
-[Anita] No, I mean she's actually evil.

00:21:38.498 --> 00:21:39.867
Not high school evil.

00:21:39.926 --> 00:21:42.246
Low Shoulder is taking a night off their national tour

00:21:42.278 --> 00:21:43.910
to play the small town school dance.

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:48.074
Which to me feels like a reference to Fallout Boy's music video- Dance, Dance.

00:21:48.122 --> 00:21:49.706
Where they play a homecoming dance.

00:21:49.818 --> 00:21:52.206
-[Guy] So I guess it's always going to be like this for guys like us.

00:21:52.308 --> 00:21:53.486
-[Pete] No way, man.

00:21:53.668 --> 00:21:54.846
One night could change it all.

00:21:54.868 --> 00:21:56.330
-[Principal] All right, ladies.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.518
Break it up.

00:21:57.684 --> 00:21:59.328
What are you looking at Powderpuff?

00:21:59.328 --> 00:22:01.934
Fallout Boy owns their own record label called Decaydance,

00:22:01.982 --> 00:22:04.974
And many of their artists are featured on the Jennifer's Body soundtrack.

00:22:05.022 --> 00:22:05.730
Which is fire.

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:08.450
Not to mention the Fallout Boy poster seen in Jennifer's room.

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:10.578
However, Jennifer doesn't go to the dance.

00:22:10.674 --> 00:22:12.967
Instead, she intercepts Chip in the park

00:22:12.967 --> 00:22:14.300
he usually cuts through to get to the school.

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:19.125
Using some kind of teleportation or super speed ability to sneak up ahead of him when he looks back.

00:22:20.614 --> 00:22:23.470
She attempts to give Chip an explanation for Needy's

00:22:23.490 --> 00:22:25.542
pulling away from the relationship as of late.

00:22:25.606 --> 00:22:28.710
Telling him that she was upset because her and Colin were intimate.

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:30.170
She doesn't mince words.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:33.894
-[Jennifer] And by that I mean they were porking on a semi-regular basis.

00:22:34.022 --> 00:22:37.562
This is another ultra toxic attempt for her to get between Needy and Chip.

00:22:37.626 --> 00:22:40.558
The real reason Needy is pulling away is because she knows Jennifer is dangerous.

00:22:40.564 --> 00:22:43.806
If she killed Colin Grey just out of jealousy because Needy said

00:22:43.828 --> 00:22:44.382
he was cool.

00:22:44.436 --> 00:22:47.522
What is she gonna do to the boy that Needy actually has a relationship with?

00:22:47.576 --> 00:22:50.466
There's an important detail in the comic that I think tells us a lot about

00:22:50.488 --> 00:22:51.518
Jennifer's behavior.

00:22:51.614 --> 00:22:52.194
Needy Lesnicki is my

00:22:52.232 --> 00:22:53.906
very best friend.

00:22:54.008 --> 00:22:57.214
Jennifer may be more popular and get more attention from boys.

00:22:57.262 --> 00:23:00.342
But nothing that happens in her dating life ever amounts to a relationship.

00:23:00.476 --> 00:23:03.282
We'd never see anything resembling another meaningful friendship even.

00:23:03.346 --> 00:23:05.286
As much as she would never admit it,

00:23:05.308 --> 00:23:07.154
she's jealous of what Needy has with Chip.

00:23:07.202 --> 00:23:10.534
And insecure about becoming less important in the eyes of her only friend.

00:23:10.652 --> 00:23:13.046
So she sabotages Needy and Chip's relationship.

00:23:13.148 --> 00:23:15.611
And when the distance between them is at its greatest,

00:23:15.611 --> 00:23:16.502
she tries to move in on Chip.

00:23:16.502 --> 00:23:18.234
Telling him that she's always cared about him.

00:23:18.272 --> 00:23:20.410
And that Needy never deserved him in the first place.

00:23:20.480 --> 00:23:23.234
It's clear that this is more about Needy than it is about Chip.

00:23:23.302 --> 00:23:24.717
When she says this...

00:23:24.717 --> 00:23:25.576
–[Jennifer] Say it like you mean it.

00:23:27.261 --> 00:23:28.717
Say I’m better than Needy.

00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:31.641
They relocate to an abandoned pool where the word hopeless is graffitied

00:23:31.641 --> 00:23:32.596
above the water.

00:23:32.596 --> 00:23:35.674
The same word that comes up time and time again in connection to Jennifer

00:23:35.722 --> 00:23:37.358
trying to socially isolate her friend.

00:23:37.444 --> 00:23:40.146
The artwork on the wall also makes it look like they're coming out of a

00:23:40.168 --> 00:23:40.782
Roman temple.

00:23:40.846 --> 00:23:43.646
Which could be connected to the information about the shrines to demonic

00:23:43.678 --> 00:23:45.646
transference at Roman archaeological sites,

00:23:45.678 --> 00:23:47.518
seen in the occultism books in the library.

00:23:47.614 --> 00:23:50.774
It could also be connected to the police cadet that Jennifer's sleeping with

00:23:50.812 --> 00:23:51.810
whose name is Roman.

00:23:51.890 --> 00:23:55.206
Jennifer tries to kiss Chip again, but this time he pulls away, telling her

00:23:55.228 --> 00:23:56.082
that it feels weird.

00:23:56.146 --> 00:23:57.778
This sends her into a rage.

00:23:57.874 --> 00:24:01.066
She throws him into the pool and thrashes him around, leaving him unable to escape.

00:24:01.088 --> 00:24:05.354
After digging her fangs into his neck, Needy shows up and let's just say,

00:24:05.392 --> 00:24:07.264
spoils the moment.

00:24:07.264 --> 00:24:09.321
(Roars)

00:24:09.321 --> 00:24:12.273
-[Anita] St Jude patron saint of hopeless causes, please give me the power to crush this b*tch.

00:24:12.750 --> 00:24:14.834
And there's that word again: Hopeless.

00:24:14.834 --> 00:24:17.066
Needy pulls her under the water surface and she disappears momentarily

00:24:17.098 --> 00:24:20.174
before reemerging and immediately getting maced in the face

00:24:20.174 --> 00:24:21.354
with Chip's pepper spray.

00:24:21.402 --> 00:24:23.306
This causes her to projectile vomit

00:24:23.338 --> 00:24:26.126
that black substance that we saw earlier when she attempted to eat the chicken.

00:24:26.148 --> 00:24:29.586
After this, she stops holding back, levitating out of the pool and

00:24:29.608 --> 00:24:30.658
floating in mid-air.

00:24:30.744 --> 00:24:33.360
It's here that the root of the tension that's been bubbling for 

00:24:33.360 --> 00:24:37.190
Jennifer and Needy's entire lives is finally addressed.

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:40.000
(IMPACT)

00:24:41.663 --> 00:24:45.547
♪ Tense Music ♪

00:24:46.010 --> 00:24:49.846
A lifetime of frustrations from their relationship comes pouring out as

00:24:49.868 --> 00:24:53.274
Needy calls Jen out for being a bad friend, chastises her for going after

00:24:53.312 --> 00:24:56.105
Chip when she, according to Needy, could have anyone.

00:24:56.105 --> 00:24:59.302
And exposes her insecurities about her looks and social relevance.

00:24:59.366 --> 00:25:02.286
It's clear that Needy has never stood up to her like this before

00:25:02.308 --> 00:25:05.210
and it sends Jennifer into an absolute rage.

00:25:05.370 --> 00:25:13.065
-[Jennifer]  I am going to eat your soul and sh*t it out Lesnicki!

00:25:13.170 --> 00:25:14.858
–[Anita] I thought you only murdered boys?

00:25:15.034 --> 00:25:16.318
–[Jennifer] I go both ways.

00:25:16.404 --> 00:25:19.762
But she stops in her tracks when Chip impales her with a pool net.

00:25:19.816 --> 00:25:22.830
Which, ironically, is the second time we've seen that on my channel lately.

00:25:22.910 --> 00:25:25.986
Since she hasn't had a meal in about a month, she doesn't regenerate right away.

00:25:26.008 --> 00:25:28.254
So she climbs out of the pool house and escapes.

00:25:28.302 --> 00:25:31.206
In the comic, she cuts through a graveyard to get home, and she's once again

00:25:31.228 --> 00:25:33.378
followed by an assorted pack of wild animals.

00:25:33.474 --> 00:25:36.918
Her condition continues to worsen as she returns home to circle boys in the yearbook,

00:25:36.924 --> 00:25:39.606
but in this case, instead of circling boys that she wants to go out with,

00:25:39.628 --> 00:25:42.794
she's circling the ones that she wants to devour, the salty ones,

00:25:42.832 --> 00:25:44.042
as she would probably put it.

00:25:44.096 --> 00:25:47.418
As she's about to drift asleep, Needy breaks in through her window

00:25:47.424 --> 00:25:48.678
and a fight to the death ensues.

00:25:48.774 --> 00:25:51.886
Like the sacrifice scene, there's definitely an underlying theme here in

00:25:51.908 --> 00:25:54.190
relation to the romantic tension between the two.

00:25:54.260 --> 00:25:56.330
Needy's weapon of choice is a box cutter.

00:25:56.410 --> 00:26:01.578
-[Anita] Do you know what this is for? It's for cutting boxes.

00:26:01.674 --> 00:26:04.926
It took me a while to figure out what the meaning of this line was,

00:26:04.948 --> 00:26:08.306
but I think it calls back to a mostly forgotten slang term from the 2000s

00:26:08.328 --> 00:26:11.154
where female genitals were sometimes referred to as- The Box.

00:26:11.272 --> 00:26:14.786
So by threatening to cut the box, Needy is symbolically moving on from her

00:26:14.808 --> 00:26:16.302
feelings towards her BFF.

00:26:16.446 --> 00:26:19.142
There's also the fact that the two used to play in the sandbox together

00:26:19.196 --> 00:26:20.178
since their childhood.

00:26:20.274 --> 00:26:21.890
-[Anita] Sandbox love never dies.

00:26:21.970 --> 00:26:25.286
Jennifer levitates both of them into the air, but the deciding factor is

00:26:25.308 --> 00:26:28.918
when Needy pulls off her BFF necklace, symbolically cutting the ties of

00:26:28.924 --> 00:26:30.902
loyalty that she has to her abusive friend.

00:26:30.956 --> 00:26:34.266
And this sends her crashing down to the mattress, where Needy finishes it by

00:26:34.288 --> 00:26:37.306
jamming the box cutter into her ex-best friend's heart.

00:26:37.408 --> 00:26:40.566
As the library books foretold, demons are weakest when hungry.

00:26:40.598 --> 00:26:43.630
But a blade to the heart is the surest way to kill the beast.

00:26:43.737 --> 00:26:44.809
-[Jennifer] My tit...

00:26:45.201 --> 00:26:47.687
-[Anita] No, your heart.

00:26:47.860 --> 00:26:50.554
It's one last joke in a story filled with funny quips,

00:26:50.602 --> 00:26:52.874
but it's also the perfect final moment for Jennifer.

00:26:52.922 --> 00:26:55.610
As Needy put it early on, tits were her trademark.

00:26:55.690 --> 00:26:58.026
They were what she used to get what she wanted at the bar.

00:26:58.068 --> 00:27:00.098
And get what she wanted from the boys in her class.

00:27:00.184 --> 00:27:03.634
But relying on a superficial beauty signifier prevented her from forming any

00:27:03.672 --> 00:27:05.502
real deep heart to heart connections.

00:27:05.566 --> 00:27:08.782
Diablo Cody actually credits this as her favorite line in the film.

00:27:08.846 --> 00:27:11.478
And what happens next really drives home the main idea.

00:27:11.564 --> 00:27:14.786
Jennifer's mom hears the commotion and comes into the room to find Needy

00:27:14.818 --> 00:27:16.562
pulling the box cutter out of her daughter.

00:27:16.626 --> 00:27:18.114
It's the first time that we see Mrs. Check.

00:27:18.162 --> 00:27:21.910
and it's a reminder that after everything, Jennifer was just a kid.

00:27:21.980 --> 00:27:25.418
Or at least a teen who was trying to grow up too fast and got burned by a

00:27:25.424 --> 00:27:27.002
group of rockers trying to use her.

00:27:27.056 --> 00:27:30.666
Needy drops the box cutter on this Flag Team magazine, again,

00:27:30.688 --> 00:27:31.866
something only a teenager would have.

00:27:31.968 --> 00:27:34.970
Through it all, Jennifer was a victim as well as a villain.

00:27:35.050 --> 00:27:37.226
She didn't ask to be turned into a succubus.

00:27:37.258 --> 00:27:39.146
And all of the strange behavior that followed

00:27:39.178 --> 00:27:41.806
represents her going through the changes that come with puberty and adulthood.

00:27:41.828 --> 00:27:44.512
But because she's not ready for any of that,

00:27:44.512 --> 00:27:45.870
she doesn't handle it well at all.

00:27:45.940 --> 00:27:49.106
You could say that her maturity was stunted that day when Low Shoulder took

00:27:49.128 --> 00:27:49.922
advantage of her.

00:27:49.976 --> 00:27:53.443
Something that we've talked about before when discussing victims of trauma on Horror History.

00:27:53.443 --> 00:27:56.766
Abuse, neglect, exposure to violence, lack of attachment,

00:27:56.798 --> 00:27:58.634
and other adverse childhood experiences

00:27:58.702 --> 00:28:00.674
affect the structure and chemistry of the brain

00:28:00.722 --> 00:28:02.898
and can stunt its natural growth and maturation.

00:28:02.994 --> 00:28:06.374
These negative experiences have an effect not only in childhood,

00:28:06.412 --> 00:28:07.254
but throughout life.

00:28:07.372 --> 00:28:10.946
Adult relationships, grief and the dissolution of childhood friendships

00:28:10.978 --> 00:28:14.006
are just a few of the challenges that she does a very poor job of coping with.

00:28:14.038 --> 00:28:17.951
That's my analysis of the character, and I pretty much know that it is correct.

00:28:17.951 --> 00:28:22.328
Not only because screenwriter Diablo Cody and I are practically the same person,

00:28:22.328 --> 00:28:24.138
but because she's actually spoken about the themes of

00:28:24.144 --> 00:28:25.642
Jennifer's Body in interviews.

00:28:25.706 --> 00:28:29.342
The theme of Jennifer's Body, said Cody, is about the horror of being a teenager.

00:28:29.342 --> 00:28:32.366
A person who is under the influence of hormones and jealousy in society

00:28:32.388 --> 00:28:35.882
is by nature combustible and scary and unpredictable.

00:28:35.946 --> 00:28:38.898
And I think anyone who's ever lived with a teenager knows this to be true.

00:28:38.984 --> 00:28:41.442
And Jennifer herself is in a special kind of hell.

00:28:41.496 --> 00:28:44.866
Where her self worth completely revolves around her sexuality and who she is

00:28:44.888 --> 00:28:46.094
as a body or a package.

00:28:46.142 --> 00:28:47.582
So that's how we began the movie.

00:28:47.646 --> 00:28:51.074
And this is also kind of a recurring theme for Cody, whose previous film, Juno,

00:28:51.122 --> 00:28:54.566
also deals with a character who is forced to grow up too quickly,

00:28:54.588 --> 00:28:56.418
A girl who gets pregnant at age 16.

00:28:56.514 --> 00:28:59.874
Juno uses the same kind of imagery that Jennifer's Body does to highlight

00:28:59.922 --> 00:29:02.866
the contrast between the young girl at the center of the story and the very

00:29:02.908 --> 00:29:04.730
adult decisions that she's forced to make.

00:29:04.800 --> 00:29:07.786
Like the call with the abortion clinic on this hamburger phone that looks

00:29:07.808 --> 00:29:08.422
like a toy.

00:29:08.486 --> 00:29:10.758
They even both have the same grading classmate.

00:29:10.854 --> 00:29:12.630
-[Su-Chin] God appreciates your miracle!

00:29:12.710 --> 00:29:14.722
-[Chastity} Low Shoulder are American heroes!

00:29:14.850 --> 00:29:18.872
Even though Juno takes place in a realistic world, there are still a lot of similarities.

00:29:18.872 --> 00:29:21.902
It seems likely that this recurring idea of the teenage girl

00:29:21.956 --> 00:29:25.534
forced into the adult world is a personal one for Cody, who sees Needy Lesnicki

00:29:25.572 --> 00:29:27.742
as a representation of herself.

00:29:27.886 --> 00:29:30.946
-[Cody] What I was really basing it on was myself, because I was going through

00:29:30.968 --> 00:29:32.002
this transition in my own life.

00:29:32.056 --> 00:29:34.274
I really am, in real life, a Needy, okay?

00:29:34.312 --> 00:29:38.334
Like, I'm a bookish, insecure, cowardly person, and my real name is Brook

00:29:38.382 --> 00:29:42.002
and I had created this Diablo Cody persona to survive and to get attention,

00:29:42.066 --> 00:29:44.406
which is something that I desperately needed at that time in my life,

00:29:44.428 --> 00:29:45.782
because nobody ever listened to me.

00:29:45.836 --> 00:29:48.426
Suddenly, for the very first time in my life, people were interested.

00:29:48.528 --> 00:29:52.986
It was definitely, like a sort of autobiographical for me,

00:29:53.008 --> 00:29:54.294
writing that movie.

00:29:54.342 --> 00:29:57.606
-[Megan] Was Jennifer kind of the projection of your alter ego then?

00:29:57.606 --> 00:29:59.794
Needy and Jennifer were Brook and Diablo?

00:29:59.794 --> 00:30:00.842
-[Diablo] Yes, exactly.

00:30:00.976 --> 00:30:04.454
After releasing Jennifer's Body, Diablo decided to step away from public life.

00:30:04.512 --> 00:30:07.838
She got pregnant a month later and focused her efforts on being a mother.

00:30:07.844 --> 00:30:11.413
The moment where Needy plunges that box cutter through Jennifer Check's heart

00:30:11.413 --> 00:30:14.394
symbolized Brook Maurio killing off her flashier,

00:30:14.442 --> 00:30:16.474
attention seeking alter ego, Diablo Cody.

00:30:16.522 --> 00:30:19.266
She stopped going to red carpets, and she took a break from being on the Internet.

00:30:19.288 --> 00:30:22.786
To this day, she has no presence on social media, which means one

00:30:22.808 --> 00:30:25.490
of you will have to put this video on a Blu ray and mail it to her.

00:30:25.560 --> 00:30:28.706
But even though people in her personal life have gotten used to calling her

00:30:28.728 --> 00:30:32.194
Brook again, she still continued to release content under the name Diablo Cody.

00:30:32.242 --> 00:30:36.230
It would seem that the alter ego survived in at least one small way.

00:30:36.300 --> 00:30:38.815
Does this mean that Jennifer Check survives, too?

00:30:38.815 --> 00:30:42.246
That she's been living in the shadows, waiting to make her return? Maybe.

00:30:42.348 --> 00:30:46.234
In a 2023 interview, the writer stated, I'm obsessed with the idea of doing

00:30:46.272 --> 00:30:48.042
something new in the world of Jennifer's Body.

00:30:48.096 --> 00:30:50.522
So we'd have to go back to Devil's Kettle, Minnesota, for that.

00:30:50.576 --> 00:30:52.214
I originally planned to pitch it as tv.

00:30:52.262 --> 00:30:53.942
But I think it's shaping up to be a movie.

00:30:54.006 --> 00:30:54.666
We'll see.

00:30:54.768 --> 00:30:55.746
Yeah. Diablo.

00:30:55.798 --> 00:30:58.558
If you're currently watching this on a Blu ray that someone sent you in the mail,

00:30:58.564 --> 00:31:00.682
please make it a movie and not tv.

00:31:00.746 --> 00:31:03.578
It's interesting how she says it's something in the world of Jennifer's Body.

00:31:03.594 --> 00:31:05.670
It leaves open a lot of possibilities.

00:31:05.770 --> 00:31:09.730
Perhaps some demonic power keeps Jennifer alive or brings her back to life.

00:31:09.800 --> 00:31:13.778
But maybe she's only being kept alive in spirit through her former friend.

00:31:13.864 --> 00:31:17.538
After she's killed in Jennifer's Body, we learn that Needy inherited

00:31:17.544 --> 00:31:18.258
some of her powers.

00:31:18.354 --> 00:31:22.614
-[Anita] Most occult scholars don't know this, but if you're bitten by

00:31:22.652 --> 00:31:26.434
a demon and you live, you just might absorb some of the demon's abilities.

00:31:26.562 --> 00:31:29.810
For Needy, this seems to include levitation and super strength.

00:31:29.890 --> 00:31:33.974
But for Brook Maurio, moving to Minnesota and reinventing herself as Diablo Cody

00:31:34.022 --> 00:31:37.114
was necessary for her to break out of her bubble and take a step

00:31:37.152 --> 00:31:38.118
forward professionally.

00:31:38.214 --> 00:31:41.514
She no longer feels the need to use that name in her personal life, but

00:31:41.552 --> 00:31:43.782
still occasionally calls upon that alter ego.

00:31:43.846 --> 00:31:46.766
Jennifer's Body has become a cult classic in the horror community,

00:31:46.868 --> 00:31:49.802
but it's just one of the greater coming of rage genre.

00:31:49.866 --> 00:31:52.586
For the full picture, you'll need to check out my other coming of rage analyses

00:31:52.618 --> 00:31:54.362
like my video on Carrie.

00:31:54.426 --> 00:31:56.430
You can find those in the playlist on the left.

00:31:56.500 --> 00:31:59.582
Remember to subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors every week.

00:31:59.636 --> 00:32:03.966
Ring the deathbell for all notifications and I'll see you in the next one.

00:32:04.068 --> 00:32:08.100
Assuming we we both survived.

